# OtterWorks Trivy Ignore List
# Every entry must state: affected service/package, why it cannot be fixed now, and a
# review date. Audited 2026-08-05 — see TRIVYIGNORE_AUDIT.md and SECURITY_BACKLOG.md.
# Note: Trivy's plain ignore format matches vulnerability IDs exactly; wildcards
# (e.g. "CVE-2021-*") are NOT expanded and must not be used.
# report-service is excluded via --skip-dirs in CI (intentional legacy Java 8 service
# for the upgrade exercise), not via this file.

# --- frontend/admin-dashboard: @angular/{common,compiler,core} 17.3.12 ---
# Cannot fix now: fixes ship only in Angular >=19.2.x; 17.x is EOL with no patch, and the
# Angular 19+ major upgrade is a separate planned effort. Review: 2026-11-01.
CVE-2025-66035
CVE-2025-66412
CVE-2026-22610
CVE-2026-27970
CVE-2026-32635

# --- services/api-gateway: golang-jwt/jwt/v5 v5.2.1 ---
# Cannot fix now: pending a standalone `go get` bump to 5.2.2 (low effort — do first).
# Review: 2026-09-01.
CVE-2025-30204

# --- services/api-gateway: otel/sdk v1.24.0 and google.golang.org/grpc v1.61.1 ---
