# toolchain than the pinned go 1.22 and a coordinated otel/grpc module upgrade.
# Review: 2026-11-01.
CVE-2026-24051
CVE-2026-39883
CVE-2026-33186

# --- services/admin-service: activestorage 7.1.6 (CVE-2026-33195 CRITICAL,
# CVE-2026-33658 MEDIUM) ---
# Cannot fix now: fixes require activestorage >=7.2.3, i.e. a Rails 7.2+ upgrade; the
# Gemfile pins rails ~> 7.1.3 and the golden-app lab depends on Rails 7.1 behavior
# (planted bug in config/environments/production.rb — see AGENTS.md). Review: 2026-11-01.
CVE-2026-33195
CVE-2026-33658

# --- services/document-service: protobuf 4.25.9 ---
# Cannot fix now: fix is protobuf 5.29.6, but opentelemetry-proto 1.23.0 pins
# protobuf <5.0; requires an OpenTelemetry Python upgrade. Review: 2026-11-01.
CVE-2026-0994

# --- services/document-service: starlette 0.37.2 ---
